Interactability_Text_Line_0 The Carioca News
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Military Discuss Isolating Niterói
Interactability_Text_Line_3 Leaked reports from the Coalition suggest talks of potentially blowing up the Rio-Niterói bridge in order to contain the unexpected horde-driven collapse of Niterói. Military authorities have stated that such plans are currently unnecessary given lack of horde activity on the bridge since.